+`.github/workflows/validate.yml:234-274` and run from the checkout root, reports 32 dead links —
+**every one inside `./.claude/worktrees/wf_b210c5be-a8e-*`**, which `.gitignore:45` excludes:
+
+```
+$ git check-ignore -v .claude/worktrees/
+.gitignore:45:.claude/worktrees/	.claude/worktrees/
